{"id":"fa153f5cc8052173","group":"16","path":"16/16-df-display-map-category.md","title":"显示映射类与其箭头范畴","display":"df-display-map-category — 显示映射类与其箭头范畴","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory","book_abbrev":"16","label":"16-df-display-map-category","aliases":["16-df-display-map-category","Display map category","16-display-map-category"],"display":"df-display-map-category — 显示映射类与其箭头范畴","depends_on":["[[16-df-display-map]]","[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","[[16-df-display-fibration]]","[[16-df-pullback-square]]"],"source":"Definition 10.4.1, pp. 610–611 (PDF 630–631); Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615 (PDF 635)","revision_date":"2026-10-16"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Jacobs — Categorical Logic and Type Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"16"},{"key":"label","html":"16-df-display-map-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>16-df-display-map-category</span><span>Display map category</span><span>16-display-map-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-display-map-category — 显示映射类与其箭头范畴"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0ba8f021ca287877\" href=\"?note=0ba8f021ca287877\" title=\"16-df-comprehension-category\">16-df-comprehension-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Definition 10.4.1, pp. 610–611 (PDF 630–631); Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615 (PDF 635)"},{"key":"revision_date","html":"2026-10-16"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为小范畴，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\\)</span> 为候选态射类。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B(X,I)\">\\(\\mathcal B(X,I)\\)</span> 表示已指定范畴的 Hom 集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\">\\(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"dacf0503b95c88a9\" href=\"?note=dacf0503b95c88a9\" title=\"16-df-pullback-square\">16-df-pullback-square</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}\">\\(\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}\\)</span> 在下文定义。仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\">\\(\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\)</span> 成立时使用下文的总范畴别名；其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"53dadf7eff1efeea\" href=\"?note=53dadf7eff1efeea\" title=\"16-df-display-fibration\">16-df-display-fibration</a> 对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal D\">\\(\\mathcal D\\)</span> 构造的全交换方块范畴。</li>\n<li>末式中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\">\\(\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a> 所引用的完整理解结构及理解投影的垂直同构闭包；其基范畴为同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B\">\\(\\mathcal B\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(X,1))\\ h=h.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(X,1))\\ h=h.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D\\cap\\mathcal B(X,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\n\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\land\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n(\\forall X,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D\\cap\\mathcal B(X,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\n\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\land\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\n(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\n(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书的 display map category 是二元结构 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\">\\((\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\)</span>，包含基底终对象与所有拉回下的闭性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf D\">\\(\\mathbf D\\)</span> 是随后由这些显示映射组成的箭头满子范畴。旧文件只构造后者，混同了两个层级。</li>\n<li>总范畴别名复用上游的完整构造：从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d:X\\to I\">\\(d:X\\to I\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"e:Y\\to J\">\\(e:Y\\to J\\)</span> 的交换方块有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:X\\to Y\">\\(a:X\\to Y\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b:I\\to J\">\\(b:I\\to J\\)</span>，满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"ea=bd\">\\(ea=bd\\)</span>；恒等与复合也在该原子中给出。因此没有未定型的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a,b)\">\\((a,b)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>末式由 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"274c21b30aac62ac\" href=\"?note=274c21b30aac62ac\" title=\"16-df-display-map\">16-df-display-map</a> 的拉回稳定性推出；终对象单独列为前提。一般理解范畴的定义本身没有要求基底有终对象，不能在这个推论里省略它。</li>\n<li>来源：Definition 10.4.1, pp. 610–611（PDF 630–631）；Corollary 10.4.5, p. 615（PDF 635）。此处明确保留两种结构之间的区别，并给历史总范畴记号带上显示映射类参数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-comprehension-category","status":"resolved","id":"0ba8f021ca287877","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-comprehension-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-display-fibration]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-df-pullback-square]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-pullback-square","status":"resolved","id":"dacf0503b95c88a9","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal B$ 为小范畴，$\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B$ 为候选态射类。$\\mathcal B(X,I)$ 表示已指定范畴的 Hom 集。$\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}$ 采用 [[16-df-pullback-square]]。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-fibration","status":"resolved","id":"53dadf7eff1efeea","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}$ 在下文定义。仅在 $\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)$ 成立时使用下文的总范畴别名；其中 $\\mathbf D$ 是 [[16-df-display-fibration]] 对同一 $\\mathcal D$ 构造的全交换方块范畴。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"末式中 $\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)$ 及 $\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map]] 所引用的完整理解结构及理解投影的垂直同构闭包；其基范畴为同一 $\\mathcal B$。","embed":false},{"target":"16-df-display-map","status":"resolved","id":"274c21b30aac62ac","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"末式由 [[16-df-display-map]] 的拉回稳定性推出；终对象单独列为前提。一般理解范畴的定义本身没有要求基底有终对象，不能在这个推论里省略它。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B(X,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B},\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\\Longleftrightarrow\n1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B\\land\n(\\forall X\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)(\\exists!h\\in\\mathcal B(X,1))\\ h=h.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n(\\forall X,I,J\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall d\\in\\mathcal D\\cap\\mathcal B(X,I))\n(\\forall u\\in\\mathcal B(J,I))\\\\\n&\\quad\\Bigl[(\\exists P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\exists a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\exists b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\ \\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land(\\forall P\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\n(\\forall a\\in\\mathcal B(P,X))(\\forall b\\in\\mathcal B(P,J))\n\\bigl(\\mathrm{PbSq}_{\\mathcal B}(a,b;d,u)\\Longrightarrow b\\in\\mathcal D\\bigr)\\Bigr],\\\\\n\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)\\Longleftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathcal D\\subseteq\\operatorname{Mor}\\mathcal B\n\\land(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\land\\mathrm{PullbackClosed}_{\\mathcal B}(\\mathcal D).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D)\\coloneqq\\mathbf D,\n\\qquad\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B)\\coloneqq\\mathbf{Disp}(\\mathcal B;\\mathcal D).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CompCat}(p,\\chi)\\land\n(\\exists1\\in\\operatorname{Ob}\\mathcal B)\\ \\mathrm{Terminal}_{\\mathcal B}(1)\n\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathrm{Disp}(p,\\chi)).","display":true},{"tex":"(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf D","display":false},{"tex":"d:X\\to I","display":false},{"tex":"e:Y\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"a:X\\to Y","display":false},{"tex":"b:I\\to J","display":false},{"tex":"ea=bd","display":false},{"tex":"(a,b)","display":false}],"bytes":3615,"backlinks":[{"id":"ed457575028b1d57","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DisplayMapCat}(\\mathcal B,\\mathcal D)$ 采用 [[16-df-display-map-category]]。$p_{\\mathcal D}=\\operatorname{cod}_{\\mathcal D}:\\mathbf D\\to\\mathcal B$ 采用 [[16-df-display-fibration]]，固定提升选择；其纤维写作 $\\mathcal D/I$。"},{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-116","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[16-df-display-map-category]]、[[16-df-relatively-cartesian-closed]]、[[16-df-dependent-product]]、[[16-thm-dep-quantifier-adjoint]]、[[16-df-power-object]]、[[16-df-singleton-map]]、[[16-lem-singleton-monic]]、[[16-thm-power-object]]。最小伴随存在性与完整含BC的理解积分别保留；singleton单态性用任意广义元素证明。"}],"outgoing":["274c21b30aac62ac","0ba8f021ca287877","53dadf7eff1efeea","dacf0503b95c88a9"]}